<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-09T17:42:57.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Insurgent fighters from the Yala area continue to engage Thai security forces, killing an insurgent trainer and another insurgent in separate operations near the Malaysian border, while Thai forces also killed a suspect in a Yala gunfight and another in a clash with security forces. Thailand received KB-5E drones after a reported Cambodia border debut and increased cybersecurity measures following European hacks, indicating a widening security focus beyond the insurgency. The Thai Air Force scrambled F-16 fighters near the Tak border in response to cross-border attacks from Myanmar, and evacuation centres are being prepared for potential refugee flows from Myanmar. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxObXdwQzZrakpjMXR3eFhOVFBZNTl4MGR1c1U0VEJDUGVqLUotbHNsRVBPT2VjemJCeENGM3lMTl8zMjU4TWpYSUsyYzlMZ3BHNndJemtkZVVMUWxtM1QweklUWEFaUHBfcDVkWmxaTWNZaVNoT3pNNU10aTJ2RmtQNzFaMlY1YTJUbHhsMlRDN051b0dnV2x6Vmc0ZHhFQTlTSFpzaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNZ3FxUFJ5VVhEQzQ3U2VVLVJJaGlLSU5RRlc3U1g4Wkt5SXI3QW9iREhCTjZvenBZOTE4OGxqaTF0aW1nbGM3UW9ldkZvUEFQWWZjZml2VW1kQi1QNF9nWGFleTRmWThLelNHVHk5cVl2NWxhUTcwbkE0UldUZnQ1Wnp0OHhfcDRxLXIydThadTZpZnNzNFhaQ3hIWUxjbFlpVVRyVDl6aTRNN0U2a0hqTXNLQnN3Y3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai Examiner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPM19sLTJPS05Zd2gzc0xRaTJxWkhGeXowYWV0WGtIOHVwd1V3Z19yNTRFelBvbE5VRmlNOEpocXhyZEF4OEQzNUpoWml1RkgzM2dOQks4WTdSSlgtMjFxMkRrN1o0c3pyd19LZnEyWlFld2xRVFltVG9ta2Z0UHd6WnUwM2ZVbUNzNnpCdXd4cWVNZy04Y05YX1E1bHVHLVJrUExmclpZc29za0Q5VmV1T3NVN0JzaUVPRU5vbFhLeE83Y18wU0xXTg?oc=